    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d385">

                <pb facs="1145" n="1139" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1139"/>

                <head>No. 38.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lieut. Young to Mr. Blount</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Honolulu, Hawaiian Islands</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-07-16"><hi rendition="#italic">July 16,
                                1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: During the day of the 17th of January,
                    1893, at Arion Hall I was in command of the artillery.</p>
                <p>Capt. Wiltse said to me: “I will not allow any fighting in the city.”</p>
                <p>Very respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lucien Young</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Lieutenant, U. S. Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. H. Blount</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Honolulu, Hawaiian Islands.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
